# Frontend stack

The app at the repo root is SvelteKit 2 + Svelte 5. The Next.js migration already landed. Do not add `next`, `react`, or React-ecosystem packages, and do not start a second frontend.

Cards, Quest and BMX harvest are built on this scaffold. Remaining work is ranked in `docs/ROADMAP.md`. Stack rationale is in `docs/TDD.md` §2. Dependabot alerts for this manifest are npm at `/`. They are not a reason to restore Next.js.
